        "id": "openstreetmap-tile-note",
        "names": {
          "en": "OpenStreetMap tiles and their usage policy",
          "zh-Hant": "OpenStreetMap 圖磚與其使用政策"
        },
        "texts": {
          "en": "Local OpenStreetMap shows the OpenStreetMap standard map, from the OpenStreetMap Foundation's tile servers, and OpenTopoMap. Map data © OpenStreetMap contributors, under the Open Database License (ODbL); the standard map's tiles are CC BY-SA 2.0 and OpenTopoMap's CC BY-SA 3.0 (https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright). Retis is not affiliated with or endorsed by the OpenStreetMap Foundation or OpenTopoMap. Their servers are donated, so Local OpenStreetMap follows the Foundation's Tile Usage Policy (https://operations.osmfoundation.org/policies/tiles/): it asks only for the tiles you view, never downloads areas in advance or in bulk, keeps the tiles it fetched in a cache on this computer, and names Retis in every request. Maps that show these tiles credit OpenStreetMap contributors. Installing it downloads the libraries it needs from the Python Package Index (PyPI) to this computer. The tile servers may limit or block access at any time.",
          "zh-Hant": "本機 OpenStreetMap 顯示 OpenStreetMap 基金會圖磚伺服器提供的 OpenStreetMap 標準地圖，以及 OpenTopoMap 地形圖。地圖資料 © OpenStreetMap 貢獻者，依開放資料庫授權（ODbL）提供；標準地圖圖磚採 CC BY-SA 2.0 授權，OpenTopoMap 圖磚採 CC BY-SA 3.0 授權（https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright）。Retis 與 OpenStreetMap 基金會及 OpenTopoMap 無關，也未經其認可。這些伺服器由捐助維持，因此本機 OpenStreetMap 遵守該基金會的圖磚使用政策（https://operations.osmfoundation.org/policies/tiles/）：只取得您正在檢視的圖磚，從不預先或大量下載區域，把取得的圖磚快取在這台電腦，並在每個請求中表明來自 Retis。顯示這些圖磚的地圖都會標示 OpenStreetMap 貢獻者。安裝時會從 Python 套件索引（PyPI）把所需程式庫下載到這台電腦。圖磚伺服器可能隨時限制或封鎖存取。"
        },
        "version": "2026-11-18"
      }
